            <button class="w-full rounded-2xl bg-[#ff5c8a] py-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-white transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-2xl hover:brightness-110 active:scale-[.99]">
              Pedir por WhatsApp
